---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Alexander" description="About Alexander.">
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">About Me</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 text-text-muted">
			I'm a recent graduate taking a gap year to build backend systems. I'd rather take the
			time to get properly technical with system architectures and backend systems, rather then
			falling short on both ends trying to handle job hunting and learning.
		</p>

		<p class="mt-4 text-text-muted">
		    My main project is <strong class="text-text">Aether-ML</strong> — a deep learning framework
			I built from scratch, with JIT-compiled kernels for both CUDA and ROCm/HIP and branch
			conditionals resolved ahead of time rather than at runtime.
		</p>
		<h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl font-bold">Hobbies</h2>

		<p class="mt-4 text-text-muted">
		    Outside of software I train (PPL UL) and build PCs. I've also spent far too many hours
			ricing my Linux desktop with Hyprland, where a working setup is always one animation curve
			away from a rewrite.
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>
